---
import DesktopIcon from "./DesktopIcon.astro";
---

<template id="desktop-arcade-template">
  <section
    class="desktop-window arcade-window"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Arcade window"
    tabindex="-1"
    data-arcade
  >
    <div class="window-titlebar" data-drag-handle>
      <span class="window-title"
        ><DesktopIcon name="game" /><strong>Arcade</strong><span
          class="window-subtitle"
        >
          / just one more round</span
        ></span
      >
      <div class="window-controls">
        <button
          type="button"
          data-window-action="minimize"
          aria-label="Minimize Arcade"><DesktopIcon name="minimize" /></button
        >
        <button
          type="button"
          data-window-action="maximize"
          aria-label="Maximize Arcade"
          aria-pressed="false"><DesktopIcon name="maximize" /></button
        >
        <button
          type="button"
          data-window-action="close"
          aria-label="Close Arcade"><DesktopIcon name="close" /></button
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="arcade-content">
      <header class="arcade-intro">
        <p class="desktop-eyebrow">A perfectly good use of five minutes</p><h2>
          Small games.<br />Big “one more try” energy.
        </h2><p>No coins needed. Pick a distraction.</p>
      </header>
      <nav class="arcade-selector" aria-label="Choose an arcade activity">
        <button
          type="button"
          data-arcade-select="memory"
          aria-pressed="true"
          aria-controls="arcade-memory"
          ><DesktopIcon name="cards" />Memory</button
        >
        <button
          type="button"
          data-arcade-select="sweep"
          aria-pressed="false"
          aria-controls="arcade-sweep"
          ><DesktopIcon name="bug" />Bug Sweep</button
        >
        <button
          type="button"
          data-arcade-select="terminal"
          aria-pressed="false"
          aria-controls="arcade-terminal"
          ><DesktopIcon name="terminal" />Terminal</button
        >
      </nav>
      <section
        id="arcade-memory"
        data-arcade-panel="memory"
        aria-labelledby="memory-title"
      >
        <div class="game-heading">
          <h3 id="memory-title">Match the syntax</h3><button
            type="button"
            class="arcade-button"
            data-memory-reset>New deal</button>
        </div>
        <p class="game-instructions">
          Flip two cards. Find all six pairs in as few moves as you can.
        </p>
        <div
          class="memory-board"
          data-memory-board
          role="group"
          aria-label="Memory cards"
        >
        </div>
        <p class="game-status" data-memory-status role="status"></p>
      </section>
      <section
        id="arcade-sweep"
        data-arcade-panel="sweep"
        aria-labelledby="sweep-title"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="game-heading">
          <h3 id="sweep-title">Ship without bugs</h3><button
            type="button"
            class="arcade-button"
            data-sweep-reset>New board</button>
        </div>
        <p class="game-instructions">
          Ten bugs are hiding here. Numbers count neighboring bugs. Reveal all
          safe squares to win. Your first reveal is always safe.
        </p>
        <div class="sweep-tools">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="arcade-button"
            data-sweep-flag
            aria-pressed="false"><DesktopIcon name="flag" />Flag mode</button
          ><span data-sweep-count>0 / 10 flagged</span>
        </div>
        <div
          class="sweep-board"
          data-sweep-board
          role="group"
          aria-label="Bug Sweep board"
        >
        </div>
        <p class="game-status" data-sweep-status role="status">
          Pick a square to begin.
        </p>
        <p class="game-instructions">
          Use arrow keys to move and Enter to play. Turn on Flag mode to mark a
          square, or right-click it.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section
        id="arcade-terminal"
        data-arcade-panel="terminal"
        aria-labelledby="terminal-title"
        hidden
      >
        <div class="game-heading">
          <h3 id="terminal-title">Pocket terminal</h3><span
            class="terminal-badge">guest session</span>
        </div>
        <p class="game-instructions">
          A few commands. A few secrets. Start with <code>help</code>.
        </p>
        <div class="pocket-terminal">
          <div
            class="terminal-output"
            role="log"
            aria-label="Terminal output"
            aria-live="polite"
            tabindex="0"
            data-terminal-output
          >
          </div>
          <form data-terminal-form>
            <label for="arcade-command"
              ><span aria-hidden="true">~ $</span><span class="sr-only"
                >Terminal command</span
              ></label
            ><input
              id="arcade-command"
              name="command"
              maxlength="120"
              autocomplete="off"
              autocapitalize="off"
              spellcheck="false"
              placeholder="help"
            /><button type="submit">Run</button>
          </form>
        </div>
        <details class="arcade-secrets">
          <summary>A small hint, if you’re curious</summary><p>
            Try <code>sudo make coffee</code> or <code>cat README.txt</code>.
            For a change of scenery, enter <code>party</code>. On the desktop,
            the old ↑ ↑ ↓ ↓ ← → ← → B A code works too.
          </p>
        </details>
      </section>
    </div>
    <footer class="library-status">
      <span>Local games. Zero stakes.</span><span
        >Take a break. You’ve earned it.</span>
    </footer>
  </section>
</template>
